id=\"456093\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/deplives\">deplives</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-08 14:07:41 +08:00\">16h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/DigitalG\">DigitalG</a> 因为之前 Tibo 经常统一重置，充值后大家的的重置时间都是统一的了，如果还有不一样的，要么是新号，要么是自己用了手动重置次数的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17951713\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0e68c9cc3e2a078873d4727ae0c1d2c1?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"sjqboss\" data-uid=\"400458\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sjqboss\">sjqboss</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-08 14:24:23 +08:00\">15h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>ChatGPT 和 codex 合并后为什么在里边聊天也消耗额度，我记得之前窗口里有个可以弹出聊天的窗口，现在找不到了。现在只能到原来 ChatGPT 里聊天才不消耗额度了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17951924\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9120/a880/92158_normal.png?m=1689669248\" alt=\"haorrs\" data-uid=\"92158\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>31</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/haorrs\">haorrs</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-08 16:11:14 +08:00\">13h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/fanwei\">fanwei</a> 三张重置卡是会区分出新的重置时间点的。另外即使是同一重置，时间周期是从你下次打开 codex 再算的，不会完全统一。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17951960\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3da6/bca1/579014_normal.png?m=1655454180\" alt=\"xubeiyou\" data-uid=\"579014\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>32</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xubeiyou\">xubeiyou</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-08 16:35:44 +08:00\">13h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>那我估计不会因为 我刚升级套餐  升级后自动重置了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17952001\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/14542d85008653367af4686fe65b8565?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"SD10\" data-uid=\"228983\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>33</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/SD10\">SD10</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-08 17:04:15 +08:00\">13h 4m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>codex 还有 5 小时的限制吗？在哪里查到的，我只能看到周量啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17952306\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f178/a1b8/133660_normal.png?m=1780295222\" alt=\"Haku\" data-uid=\"133660\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>35</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Ha